---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';

const description =
  'Terms of use for Click Action AI Review. This site is an independent review. Purchases are made with the vendor on JVZoo.';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service" description={description} canonicalURL="/terms">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <Breadcrumbs
        items={[
          { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
          { label: 'Terms', href: '/terms' },
        ]}
      />
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Terms of service</h1>
      <p class="lede">Last updated October 23, 2026. These terms cover your use of clickactionai.info.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>The site is a review, not the store</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">
        Click Action AI Review publishes opinions, comparisons, and instructions for bonuses we provide. We do not sell Click Action AI. When you use a button on this site, you leave for a JVZoo checkout operated by the vendor’s seller account. The purchase contract is between you and that seller. Delivery, refunds, and product support are their responsibility, on the terms shown at checkout.
      </p>
      <h2>No promise of results</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">
        Examples on this site, including hours saved or money compared with a hire, are illustrations. They are not a promise that you will save a specific amount, win clients, or finish every website task. The software can stop on logins, CAPTCHAs, and sites that block automated browsers. You are responsible for the prompts you run and for following the rules of the sites you visit.
      </p>
      <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">
        We may earn a commission if you buy through our links, at no extra cost to you. Details are on the <a class="text-link" href="/affiliate-disclosure">affiliate disclosure</a> page.
      </p>
      <h2>Bonuses</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">
        Bonus files are sent by email after we can match a receipt to a purchase made through this site. They are for your own use. Do not resell them or present them as the vendor’s product. We can refuse a request that does not match an order from these links.
      </p>
      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">
        Do not use this site to break the law, to scrape it in a way that disrupts it, or to send abusive email to the bonus address. Do not copy the pages and republish them as your own review.
      </p>
      <h2>Liability</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">
        The site is provided as-is. To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for the product you buy, for decisions you make from the review, or for indirect losses. If a law where you live does not allow that limit, the limit applies only as far as that law allows. Nothing here removes rights you have against the seller of the product.
      </p>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p class="section-copy">
        We can update these terms by posting a new version on this page. The date at the top will change with it. Continuing to use the site after that update means you accept the new version.
      </p>
      <p class="section-copy">
        Questions about these terms or the bonus files: bonuses@clickactionaireview.com. Questions about a charge or a refund: the vendor, through the JVZoo order page.
      </p>
      <p class="section-copy">
        <a class="text-link" href="/privacy-policy">Privacy policy</a>
        {' · '}
        <a class="text-link" href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate disclosure</a>
        {' · '}
        <a class="text-link" href="/">Back to the review</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
